<%- include('partials/head', { pageTitle }) %>
<%- include('partials/top-nav') %>

<main class="main-container">
  <%- include('partials/flash') %>

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-banner">
      <div>
        <h1 class="hero-title">创新设计赛（航模方向）<br />作品提交系统</h1>
        <div class="hero-subtitle">登录后可完成赛道选择、上传材料、草稿保存及最终提交</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="quick-menu">
      <div class="quick-menu-item"><img src="/public/assets/icon-bmzx.png" alt="报名中心" /><span>报名中心</span></div>
      <div class="quick-menu-item"><img src="/public/assets/icon-csfs.png" alt="参赛指南" /><span>参赛指南</span></div>
      <div class="quick-menu-item"><img src="/public/assets/icon-ncjcx.png" alt="成绩查询" /><span>成绩查询</span></div>
      <div class="quick-menu-item"><img src="/public/assets/icon-zscx.png" alt="证书查询" /><span>证书查询</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="login-wrap">
    <div class="section-card">
      <h2 class="section-title">赛事说明 <img src="/public/assets/icon-zs1.png" alt="" /></h2>
      <p class="section-tip">
        登录账号为学生报名号，初始密码为报名号后8位。登录后需先确认“知识类”或“创新设计类”赛道，确认后不可更改。
        选择“创新设计类”后，可上传作品研究设计报告、证明材料、诚信承诺书，并支持草稿保存和最终提交。
      </p>

      <div class="note-box">
        请提前下载《诚信承诺书》用于后续提交，需由学生和指导教师签字后再扫描上传。<br />
        模板下载：<a href="/downloads/integrity-template">《诚信承诺书》空白模板</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="login-card">
      <h2>账号登录</h2>
      <form method="post" action="/login">
        <div class="field-group">
          <label class="field-label" for="registrationNo">报名号</label>
          <input class="input" id="registrationNo" name="registrationNo" placeholder="请输入报名号" required />
        </div>

        <div class="field-group">
          <label class="field-label" for="password">密码</label>
          <input class="input" id="password" name="password" type="password" placeholder="请输入密码" required />
        </div>

        <div class="note-box">
          初始密码规则：报名号后8位。<br />
          演示账号示例：`202600010001`，密码：`00010001`
        </div>

        <div class="actions-row">
          <button class="primary-btn" type="submit">登录系统</button>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
